	)
	(text "This converter supplies the 1.8 V auxiliary domain of MIRA's FPGA subsystem.\nThe FPGA coordinates memristor-matrix timing, receives ADC data and handles\nfast host links. Separate enable and status signals let the power manager\nsequence this domain with the other FPGA supplies."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c64353f-3e98-45e5-97ce-7a76f9cb48af")
	)
	(text "FPGA5V5 -> AUX18_RAW; L1301 + C1304 filter the output.\nVOS and feedback sense RAW before R1305."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22 81.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87a39801-6c90-412a-a5f7-e77ff34b1a77")
	)
	(text "RAW: 1.8 V nominal; shunt: 20 mV/A.\nPGR_AUX18: RAW status, pulled up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76 49.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "90dc4429-adbd-4e64-93b7-017c7ca53ee7")
	)
	(text "R1303 (20 kOhm) and R1304 (16 kOhm) set the RAW voltage:\nV(AUX18_RAW)=0.8 V x (1+R1303/R1304) = 1.8 V.\nTo change it: R1303 = R1304 x (VRAW / 0.8 V - 1). Increasing R1303 raises the\nvoltage. DEF is grounded; the +5% margin is disabled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "acfd1122-29d3-4e2b-992b-23c47342ca26")
	)
	(text "Buck conversion and filtering"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22 77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae43584d-7537-4d80-892c-bf14607aa783")
	)
	(text "U1301 (TPS62130A) receives FPGA5V5 at AVIN and both PVIN pins. C1302 (10 uF)\nand C1303 (100 nF) bypass the input. CMD_AUX18 drives Q1301; a high command\nenables EN_AUX18. R1301 (100 kOhm) pulls EN low when Q1301 is off. FPGA5V5\nmust be available first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 65.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5316271-2ffd-417c-a5d4-36e696728af7")
	)
	(text "L1301 (2.2 uH) and C1304 (47 uF nominal) filter the switched output. VOS\nsenses AUX18_RAW; FSW tied to RAW selects the approximately 1.25 MHz mode as\nRAW rises. Power-save operation is automatic at light load. C1301 (10 nF) on\nSS/TR gives an approximately 5 ms ramp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 90.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd94c7d1-de29-48cd-9a2c-9db633b79bd7")
	)
